{% comment %}
  Photo Upload - cart page entry point
  Version: 2026-09-12.1

  The single line the cart template needs, ABOVE the cart items:

      {% render 'photo-upload-cart' %}

  Position matters: the style block hides the quantity steppers from first
  paint, and a browser can paint markup it has already parsed before it reaches
  a later <style>. Placed below the items, a stepper about to disappear flashes
  up first.

  Standalone - no dependency on photo-upload-core or photo-upload-styles.
{% endcomment %}
{% render 'cart-quantity-control' %}
